<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE reference PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Reference//EN" "reference.dtd">
<reference id="git-addon-git-branch-manager-view">
  <title>Git Branch Manager View</title>
  <shortdesc>The controls in the <ph keyref="plugin-git-client"/> Git Branch Manager view.</shortdesc>
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <indexterm>Git Client add-on<indexterm>Git Branch Manager view</indexterm></indexterm>
      </keywords>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
  <refbody>
    <section id="section_overview">
      <title>Overview</title>
      <p>Open the
        <uicontrol conkeyref="branch-uicontrols/branch-view"/> view
        from the
        <uicontrol conkeyref="gs-uicontrols/gs-open-branch-manager"/>
        toolbar button, from
        <menucascade><uicontrol>Window</uicontrol><uicontrol>Show View</uicontrol></menucascade>, or
        with <uicontrol conkeyref="menu-uicontrols/menu-show-branches"/>
        in the <uicontrol conkeyref="menu-uicontrols/menu-git"/>
        menu.</p>
      <p>
        <fig>
          <title>Git Branch Manager View</title>
          <image href="img/branches/branch_manager_view.png" placement="inline"/>
        </fig>
      </p>
    </section>
    <section id="section_tree">
      <title>Branch Tree</title>
      <p>The tree groups branches under
        <uicontrol conkeyref="branch-uicontrols/branch-local"/> and
          <uicontrol conkeyref="branch-uicontrols/branch-remote"/>
        nodes. Hovering a branch shows its last commit's author and date. Opening the view or using
          <uicontrol conkeyref="branch-uicontrols/branch-refresh"/>
        fetches in the background. Right-click the
          <uicontrol conkeyref="branch-uicontrols/branch-remote"/>
        node to fetch all remotes or a single remote such as <codeph>origin</codeph>.</p>
    </section>
    <section id="section_actions">
      <title>Branch Actions</title>
      <p>Right-click a local branch for
          <uicontrol conkeyref="branch-uicontrols/branch-checkout"/>,
          <uicontrol conkeyref="branch-uicontrols/branch-create"/>,
          <uicontrol conkeyref="branch-uicontrols/branch-merge"/>,
          <uicontrol conkeyref="branch-uicontrols/branch-squash-merge"/>,
          <uicontrol conkeyref="branch-uicontrols/branch-track-remote"/>,
          <uicontrol conkeyref="menu-uicontrols/menu-push"/>,
          <uicontrol conkeyref="menu-uicontrols/menu-pull"/>,
          <uicontrol conkeyref="branch-uicontrols/branch-show-in-history"/>,
        and
          <uicontrol conkeyref="branch-uicontrols/branch-delete"/>.
        For a remote branch, use
          <uicontrol conkeyref="branch-uicontrols/branch-checkout"/>
        to create a matching local branch.</p>
    </section>
  </refbody>
</reference>
